 from the register under paragraph 4 of the Tenth Schedule to this Act (cancellation of
 registration); 

 (j) he is person in respect of whom a prohibition has been imposed under section 123 of
 this Act power to prohibit private fostering); 

 (k) he has at any time been refused registration in respect of day care or child minding.

